      "label": "Assessed value, loans, interest, interest subsidies and conversion expenditure for multi-dwelling buildings (IKU), municipal housing companies by region, number of dwellings and type of account. (Sample survey, see footnotes). Year 2001-2015",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2017-06-02T07:30:00Z",
      "link": {
